    <briefdescription>
<para>Implementation of <ref refid="structllvm_1_1format__provider" kindref="compound">format_provider&lt;T&gt;</ref> for duration types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The options string of a duration type has the grammar:</para>
<para>duration_options ::= [unit][show_unit [number_options]] unit ::= <computeroutput>h</computeroutput>|<computeroutput>m</computeroutput>|<computeroutput>s</computeroutput>|<computeroutput>ms|</computeroutput>us<computeroutput>|</computeroutput>ns<computeroutput> / show_unit ::= </computeroutput>+<computeroutput> | </computeroutput>-` number_options ::= options string for a integral or floating point type</para>
<sect1 id="structllvm_1_1format__provider_3_01std_1_1chrono_1_1duration_3_01_rep_00_01_period_01_4_01_4_1autotoc_md37">
<title>Examples</title></sect1>
<sect1 id="structllvm_1_1format__provider_3_01std_1_1chrono_1_1duration_3_01_rep_00_01_period_01_4_01_4_1autotoc_md38">
<title>| options | Input | Output |</title><para>| &quot;&quot; | 1s | 1 s | | &quot;ms&quot; | 1s | 1000 ms | | &quot;ms-&quot; | 1s | 1000 | | &quot;ms-n&quot; | 1s | 1,000 | </para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="structllvm_1_1format__provider_3_01std_1_1chrono_1_1duration_3_01_rep_00_01_period_01_4_01_4_1autotoc_md39">
<title>| &quot;&quot; | 1.0s | 1.00 s |</title><para>If the unit of the duration type is not one of the units specified above, it is still possible to format it, provided you explicitly request a display unit or you request that the unit is not displayed. </para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
